cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Entangled Cognition Protocol (ECP)
message: >-
  If you use this protocol or software, please cite both the
  protocol repository and the associated Springer chapter.
type: software

authors:
  - given-names: Mathew
    family-names: Mytka
    affiliation: EarthianLabs
    email: m3untold@gmail.com

repository-code: https://github.com/m3data/entangled-cognition-protocol
url: https://github.com/m3data/entangled-cognition-protocol

abstract: >-
  A field-based research framework for studying cognition as a
  relational, embodied, and socio-technical process. ECP explores
  how meaning emerges through dynamic relational fields across
  humans, machines, ecologies, and symbolic environments. Includes
  the Field Journal web interface for logging experiments and
  reflections, measurement frameworks, and theoretical scaffolding
  grounded in Meta-E: Entangled Cognition.

keywords:
  - entangled cognition
  - human-AI interaction
  - relational epistemology
  - phenomenology
  - 4E cognition
  - participatory sense-making
  - somatic sovereignty
  - cognitive ecology

